 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 1.88,
   "text": "Daniel prayed three times a day."
  },
  {
   "start": 2.66,
   "end": 4.28,
   "text": "Studies say many of us check our phones"
  },
  {
   "start": 4.28,
   "end": 5.92,
   "text": "over 100 times a day."
  },
  {
   "start": 6.58,
   "end": 8.04,
   "text": "So why is prayer so hard?"
  },
  {
   "start": 8.82,
   "end": 10.76,
   "text": "Most people say, I'm too busy."
  },
  {
   "start": 11.3,
   "end": 12.78,
   "text": "But notice who Daniel was."
  },
  {
   "start": 13.36,
   "end": 15.94,
   "text": "One of three leaders over 120 princes."
  },
  {
   "start": 16.68,
   "end": 18.06,
   "text": "The busiest man in the kingdom."
  },
  {
   "start": 18.88,
   "end": 20.64,
   "text": "Then his enemies got a law signed."
  },
  {
   "start": 21.26,
   "end": 24.1,
   "text": "Pray to anyone but the king and you go to the lions."
  },
  {
   "start": 24.82,
   "end": 28.56,
   "text": "And Daniel, he kneeled upon his knees three times a day"
  },
  {
   "start": 28.56,
   "end": 31.52,
   "text": "and prayed and gave thanks before his God"
  },
  {
   "start": 31.52,
   "end": 32.92,
   "text": "as he did a four time."
  },
  {
   "start": 33.64,
   "end": 34.88,
   "text": "As he did a four time."
  },
  {
   "start": 35.42,
   "end": 37.16,
   "text": "He didn't start praying because of trouble."
  },
  {
   "start": 37.54,
   "end": 38.64,
   "text": "He was already praying."
  },
  {
   "start": 39.48,
   "end": 41.12,
   "text": "Prayer isn't hard because we're busy."
  },
  {
   "start": 41.74,
   "end": 44.42,
   "text": "It's hard because something else got our attention first."
  },
  {
   "start": 45.4,
   "end": 46.28,
   "text": "Jesus made it simple."
  },
  {
   "start": 47.12,
   "end": 50.36,
   "text": "Enter into thy closet and when thou has shut thy door,"
  },
  {
   "start": 50.78,
   "end": 52.6,
   "text": "pray to thy father which is in secret."
  },
  {
   "start": 53.52,
   "end": 55.5,
   "text": "Shut the door, put the phone down."
  },
  {
   "start": 56.28,
   "end": 60.18,
   "text": "David said, evening and morning and at noon will I pray"
  },
  {
   "start": 60.76,
   "end": 62.18,
   "text": "and he shall hear my voice."
  },
  {
   "start": 62.84,
   "end": 65.58,
   "text": "He shall hear every single time."
  },
  {
   "start": 66.32,
   "end": 68.92,
   "text": "So be honest, how many times did you pray today?"
  },
  {
   "start": 69.5,
   "end": 70.04,
   "text": "Just the number."
  }
 ],
